Hana: No, thanks.

27
00:01:45.015 --> 00:01:47.538
Dad: Look, Bada! It's your favorite!

28
00:01:47.539 --> 00:01:49.668
Chocolate ice cream! Bada:

29
00:01:49.669 --> 00:01:52.017
No, thank you. I

30
